learn.\n\nWhether it\u2019s AI engineering, machine learning, career growth, cracking AI/ML interviews, building real-world projects, or understanding how AI is actually used in companies, I\u2019m happy to share what I\u2019ve learned.\n\nSo tell me in the comments: What topics would you genuinely love to see me cover? \ud83d\udc47\n\nYour suggestions will help shape what I create next! \u2764\ufe0f", "timestamp": 1791735369, "like_count": 5}, {"author": "gardlyradicle", "author_id": "1298994498", "id": "17995086771045888", "text": "aah really wish I could hear this...sound's not available in my region...", "timestamp": 1791735173, "like_count": 3}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DeXCWyfgHgz/", "original_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DeXCWyfgHgz/", "webpage_url_basename": "DeXCWyfgHgz", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "playlist": null, "playlist_index": null, "thumbnail": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/842574693_1669685824731260_5421574693682776985_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ig_cache_key=NDAwNTY4MDc1NTcwNjQ2MDIxMTE2Njk2ODU4MjEzOTc5Mjc%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEyMDYuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=xxDu72ZJKH8Q7kNvwG0YWA4&_nc_oc=AdoN5mpVi4zKXnznBBVUYo-Ghym_0gKRRn_fzmzl9URVW880i8SxKmMC0hsqB2hIcq0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=mb4ZOeFPcIMjL91K2dVY5A&_nc_ss=79689&oh=00_AQOPSQ_DXiHvNAj8mWCSgm_EdhGVEVBdm2_gCzUOchKn_g&oe=6AE62724", "display_id": "DeXCWyfgHgz", "fulltitle": "Video by jam.with.ai", "upload_date": "20261011", "release_year": null, "requested_subtitles": null, "_has_drm": null, "epoch": 1793081438, "url": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t16/f2/m84/AQNM4ubxi9vn2o7GIA72qCdfdm9wLyFmQ4NnA-P881cm1mDFDOhcPtBUgo1zTlSQaIMoQHGoH0Kl3OyoJm8bbVGMPY62r9OZCvMmxaw.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.